        {
          "text": "Elyo bana ba-Israyeli nibakakwiilila Jehova, Jehova wakabusizya bana ba-Israyeli mufutuli iwakabafutula, nkukuti Otiniyeli mwana wa-Kenazi mwanike wa-Kale be. ",
