        {
          "text": "Muuya wa-Jehova wakamuselukila, elyo wakabeteka ba-Israyeli, alimwi wakaya kuyoolwana, nkabela Jehova wakaaba Kusani-Risatayimu mwami wa-Mesopotamiya mumaanza aakwe, Ijanza lyakwe lyakalemena Kusani-Risatayimu, ",
