            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakabaambila kuti, Amutobele ndime, nkaambo Jehova waaba basinkondonyoko ba-Moabu mumaanza aanu. Mpawo bakamutobela, bakaakujata zito zyaku-Jordano zilangene anyika ya-Moabu, alimwi teebakazumizya muntu naba omwe kuzu-buka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
